{"id":"res-003","category":"Mind-Body Resilience","subcategory":"Nervous System Regulation","content_type":"situation_based","title":"Navigating a Stress Spike","affirmation":null,"situation":"Feeling overwhelmed by a mounting to-do list or sudden academic pressure.","tone":"gentle","purpose":"Ground the nervous system using physiological signals of safety.","duration_minutes":5,"practice_steps":["Exhale for longer than you inhale to signal safety to the brain.","Place one hand on your chest and one on your belly, feeling the rise and fall.","Gently rock your body from side to side or shift your weight to feel the floor beneath you."],"reflection_questions":["How did my breathing pattern change during this exercise?","Do I feel a slight shift in the intensity of my tension?"],"journaling_prompt":"What are the early warning signs that my nervous system is entering a 'fight or flight' state?","closing_message":"Your nervous system is doing its job to protect you; you can gently guide it back to safety.","tags":["vagus-nerve","grounding","anxiety-management"]}
{"id":"res-004","category":"Mind-Body Resilience","subcategory":"Meaning & Purpose","content_type":"practice","title":"Micro-Purpose Identification","affirmation":null,"situation":null,"tone":"empowering","purpose":"Find small anchors of meaning to sustain the spirit during periods of burnout.","duration_minutes":15,"practice_steps":["List three small things that brought a flicker of peace or curiosity today.","Identify one core value, such as kindness or authenticity, that you wish to embody.","Plan one tiny, low-energy action for tomorrow that aligns with that value."],"reflection_questions":["Does focusing on small meanings feel different than chasing large, daunting goals?","What small things sustain me when I feel emotionally empty?"],"journaling_prompt":"What are the quiet, uncomplicated things that make life feel worth sustaining today?","closing_message":"Purpose does not have to be a grand life plan; it can be a single, meaningful moment.","tags":["purpose","burnout-recovery","values"]}

